@startuml
' Evidence: src/experiences/mylibrary/MyLibrary.tsx (addToReadingList, startReading, moveSelectedToCompleted, saveReview, removeSelected)
' Evidence: src/experiences/mylibrary/types.ts (CuratedLibraryState and BookReview)
!include _theme.iuml

title How an Owner manages a book

state "Not in My Library" as Outside
state "Reading list" as ReadingList
state "Currently reading" as Current
state "Completed" as Completed

[*] --> Outside
Outside --> ReadingList : Add from catalogue
ReadingList --> Current : Start reading
Current --> ReadingList : Start a different book
ReadingList --> Completed : Complete and submit review
Current --> Completed : Complete and submit review
Completed --> Completed : Edit review

note right of Completed
  Completing a book requires a rating.
  A written comment is optional.
end note

note bottom of Current
  Starting a different book returns
  the previous current book to the list.
end note

note bottom
  The Owner can remove a book from any of
  these My Library locations.
end note
@enduml
